yloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"355146801abf828e2c67af991856d87fcefcaeae4a39949b89632e448a1de049","event_uuid":"deefae56-ed50-4008-ac4c-e8ccb78805ea","position":{"commit_sha":"0d3075f52f1b4af4e72b7ecc106ed792b6fb64e2","position":"1787816608265005177-deefae56-ed50-4008-ac4c-e8ccb78805ea"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"e031d7f3e24851657ce5bc2fc5d19bb24094bc8a31873c959aa4463748d53bde","event_uuid":"8f7caca5-c2bb-4c84-bd38-196e72bba64a","position":{"commit_sha":"fc7adf4cd748ff9dbc43ec12594ae32a8e71c31b","position":"1787817743676615001-8f7caca5-c2bb-4c84-bd38-196e72bba64a"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"49a4964e1f7cb3f977ffd767a0a8b0b378aa0fe8b97e68d92809285a2abfb3c5","event_uuid":"6c024235-e710-434b-b429-30dee2dc3021","position":{"commit_sha":"0ed93a2770a74efe735a92c73b7f9a96c9eea890","position":"1787817753949605001-6c024235-e710-434b-b429-30dee2dc3021"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"close_class":"flaky","comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Root cause confirmed from run 33035272265 vs last green run 32696579734: the DC Lucene reindex latency on the ephemeral CI instance routinely runs 83-90s (green run's own per-test setup times: 90.73s, 83.30s), leaving ~0 margin against the fixed 90s search-visibility budget. This run it exceeded 90s -> both rich-text tests failed in _wait_until_search_reflects (write landed, SEARCH lagged). Fix: default budget 90s -> 240s, env-tunable via REBAR_DC_SEARCH_INDEX_TIMEOUT, mirroring 1d21's Cloud search-index-lag hardening. Pushed as Gerrit change 2262. Validation: re-dispatched Live External run must show DC lane GREEN.","timestamp":1787806927387393001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Closed CERTIFIED (class flaky). Fix landed as Gerrit change 2262 (LLM-Review +1, Verified +1, MERGED to origin/main): widened _wait_until_search_reflects budget 90s->240s, env-tunable via REBAR_DC_SEARCH_INDEX_TIMEOUT. Re-dispatching Live External run to prove DC lane GREEN.","timestamp":1787808651777036001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"ROOT CAUSE (widening was insufficient — reopened). Live run 33042729934: DC lane FAILED again. Both rich-text tests hit 'the index never reflected the pushed body within 240s (120 attempts)' — indexed description stayed None at creation-time. This run the whole DC step ran ~2x normal (~100min), i.e. the ephemeral instance's background reindex thread was starved. Per ADR 0037 §3 the DC index lag is UNBOUNDED, so NO fixed timeout is robust — the Aug-24 green run only got lucky at ~85s. Sibling suites that wait on labels/summary passed, confirming it is the starved background reindex, not a returned-field problem. NEW FIX: force a synchronous per-issue reindex (POST /rest/api/2/reindex/issue?issueId=..., admin, Jira 8.17.1) after each description write so the JQL search reflects deterministically; keep the existing wait as fast confirmation and as a safe fallback if the endpoint 404s (no regression). Cloud mutation lane GREEN this run.","timestamp":1787815974048616001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Fix pushed as Gerrit change 2264 (https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/2264). Held-out RED->GREEN: tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_dc_force_reindex.py (3 tests) pins force_issue_reindex's contract offline. Pre-flight green: make lint, make typecheck (674 files), 64 DC-related unit tests. Awaiting LLM-Review + Verified, then re-dispatch Live External.","timestamp":1787816221989744001}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1787806744875546001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"909c982f-8509-4244-b0cb-bd6f33887d31","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"1d21-887e-a923-470e"},{"link_uuid":"5bc5aad2-140d-4ed5-9a14-172011a12f73","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"8733-80c6-8999-4583"},{"link_uuid":"1907ee14-caaa-42e9-acde-fbf3ad714bea","provenance":"derived","relation":"caused_by","target_id":"3289-7fe4-2fea-4c35"},{"link_uuid":"deefae56-ed50-4008-ac4c-e8ccb78805ea","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"c9fb-aab0-77e6-4d17"}],"description":"## Problem\nThe live Jira DC lane's rich-text fidelity tests (tests/external/live_jira_dc/test_dc_rich_text_live.py) time out in _wait_until_search_reflects, which blocks until a JQL SEARCH reflects a just-pushed description. Its budget is a FIXED timeout=90.0s with a fixed 2s poll.\n\nJira DC's Lucene index is eventually consistent and, on the ephemeral CI instance under load, reindex latency routinely runs 83-90s: in the last GREEN run (32696579734, Aug 24) these same tests PASSED but with per-test setup times of 90.73s and 83.30s — right at the 90s ceiling. In run 33035272265 the index was slightly slower and both tests failed with 'the index never reflected the pushed body ... within 90s (45 attempts)'. The test's own message says: 'This is NOT a bridge defect — the write succeeded, the SEARCH cannot see it yet.'\n\n## Root cause\nFixed 90s search-index-lag budget with essentially zero margin over the observed ~90s reindex latency. Same search-index-lag class that ticket 1d21 hardened for the Cloud probe (fixed 6x5s -> capped-exponential to 195s); the DC rich-text helper (_wait_until_search_reflects) was never hardened.\n\n## Fix\nRaise the DC search-visibility budget to carry real margin over the observed ~90s reindex latency (consistent with the Cloud hardening's worst-case ~195s), keeping the SEARCH-visibility semantics (not a direct GET) and the fail-loud 'not a bridge defect' assertion.\n\n## Impact\nBlocks the RP-03 epic's Live-External AC (requires the DC lane GREEN). 71 coordinator tests pass; only these 2 rich-text render tests (a co-resident story-3388 suite) flake on index lag.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/external/live_jira_dc/_dc_support.py","reason":"add force_issue_reindex helper: synchronous Jira DC per-issue reindex so JQL search reflects a just-pushed description deterministically instead of waiting on the unbounded background reindexer"},{"path":"tests/external/live_jira_dc/test_dc_rich_text_live.py","reason":"call force_issue_reindex after each description push/edit in _push_and_converge and the jira-side conflict edit; thread dc_request into both tests"},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_dc_force_reindex.py","reason":"NEW held-out offline unit test: force_issue_reindex issues the correct reindex POST and no-ops safely on a failed id read"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_reopened_at":1787815754243617001,"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["relates_to","8733-80c6-8999-4583"],["relates_to","c9fb-aab0-77e6-4d17"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"8f7caca5-c2bb-4c84-bd38-196e72bba64a","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":[],"ticket_id":"2c60-c6d5-30bf-41bb","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Live-DC rich-text search-index wait budget too marginal (90s) — flakes on Lucene lag","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["f3cb2e42-5898-4596-9c86-09d067f5cda5","5bc5aad2-140d-4ed5-9a14-172011a12f73","144894ba-b58d-4dc9-9699-efd34cda23d0","a59c6650-a182-4437-88a1-9d397b129d31","1907ee14-caaa-42e9-acde-fbf3ad714bea","d843cd3a-35f6-497c-bcf9-27ba6ba683a3","5f614f6b-3364-48aa-804b-086334293adb","2c1831a1-bfcb-45b1-9328-5307e65456be","62f8adc9-cb16-428d-ad58-a21751418538","649b0743-f598-477f-b08f-89e90ad0ed67","c19285f7-9d9a-45a9-acc1-65a66be3387c","ef563a3d-a02d-443f-97b5-95898d186c9e","deefae56-ed50-4008-ac4c-e8ccb78805ea","8f7caca5-c2bb-4c84-bd38-196e72bba64a","6c024235-e710-434b-b429-30dee2dc3021"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787821809521490479,"uuid":"a770b452-01e7-4d59-97f5-5d325f8aa567"}